{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00126",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Morning! Make yourself comfortable. Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.0,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yes, you know, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.9,
      "end_seconds": 14.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.81,
      "end_seconds": 22.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "I'm here because of very heavy periods. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.02,
      "end_seconds": 30.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "So, how long has this been going on? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.31,
      "end_seconds": 38.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.77,
      "end_seconds": 41.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Mm-hm. On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.1,
      "end_seconds": 50.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "I'd say mild. I mean, uh, and I've been passing clots as well, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.67,
      "end_seconds": 56.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Have you had very heavy periods before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.98,
      "end_seconds": 61.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.64,
      "end_seconds": 63.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.62,
      "end_seconds": 67.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.42,
      "end_seconds": 72.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Any weight loss, pain during sex or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.5,
      "end_seconds": 74.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.0,
      "end_seconds": 77.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.28,
      "end_seconds": 83.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.51,
      "end_seconds": 87.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Okay, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.11,
      "end_seconds": 88.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.69,
      "end_seconds": 104.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.29,
      "end_seconds": 107.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.06,
      "end_seconds": 110.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.15,
      "end_seconds": 114.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.67,
      "end_seconds": 118.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.59,
      "end_seconds": 120.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Penicillin, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.0,
      "end_seconds": 125.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.52,
      "end_seconds": 130.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Yes, an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.82,
      "end_seconds": 142.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.43,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Right, so that's your known an underactive thyroid. We'll keep that in mind today. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.21,
      "end_seconds": 154.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.69,
      "end_seconds": 156.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.24,
      "end_seconds": 161.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.82,
      "end_seconds": 166.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Okay, so mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.12,
      "end_seconds": 172.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.66,
      "end_seconds": 182.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "I'm on Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid. Mefenamic acid. I take it 500 milligrams, when the pain is bad."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.18,
      "end_seconds": 188.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Okay, how long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.36,
      "end_seconds": 193.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "For two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.24,
      "end_seconds": 198.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.82,
      "end_seconds": 199.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.88,
      "end_seconds": 203.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.58,
      "end_seconds": 222.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "The tummy is soft, a little tender in the lower part, and there's no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.97,
      "end_seconds": 225.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.87,
      "end_seconds": 239.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "You look a little pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.52,
      "end_seconds": 241.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.6,
      "end_seconds": 254.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.95,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is heavy periods with a cause still to find. I'd also keep a hormonal imbalance in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.24,
      "end_seconds": 257.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Is it something serious, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.08,
      "end_seconds": 274.68,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now heavy periods with a cause still to find is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had very heavy periods, since last night, mild, and no weight loss or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.16,
      "end_seconds": 279.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I mean, you know, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.31,
      "end_seconds": 293.51,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for heavy periods. I'd like you to take tranexamic acid, 500 milligrams, three times a day during periods, for three cycles. That's for heavy bleeding. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.86,
      "end_seconds": 296.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.32,
      "end_seconds": 311.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "Keep a note of how many pads you use each day and the dates, it helps us a lot. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.62,
      "end_seconds": 327.51,
      "duration_seconds": 15.89,
      "text": "Mm. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you soak through a pad every hour or feel faint. Please come and see me after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.84,
      "end_seconds": 328.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.52,
      "end_seconds": 336.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.49,
      "end_seconds": 345.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "So, I take the tranexamic acid, 500 milligrams, three times a day during periods and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.81,
      "end_seconds": 351.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.03,
      "end_seconds": 356.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Hmm, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}